<title>FRANCE: Three ships loading wheat in Rouen, five more due.</title>
<headline>Three ships loading wheat in Rouen, five more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three ships were loading a total of 69,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The wheat was destined for Cuba and Italy, they said.</p>
<p>Five more ships were expected in Rouen by June 15 to load 35,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
